.md
## Round-trip baseline
This baseline measures the fastest frontend/kernel ping-pong loop with no meaningful payload. The result is used as a reference line in the final plot and as the latency correction for frontend-to-kernel JSON measurements.

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## Round-trip baseline
This baseline measures the fastest frontend/kernel ping-pong loop with no meaningful payload. The result is used as a reference line in the final plot and as the latency correction for frontend-to-kernel JSON measurements.

