## Kernel to frontend (JSON)
These tests send Wolfram expressions to JavaScript through the normal JSON path and wait until the frontend has interpreted the payload. Numeric and mixed payload shapes are measured separately because serialization cost and JavaScript parsing behavior can differ significantly.

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## Kernel to frontend (JSON)
These tests send Wolfram expressions to JavaScript through the normal JSON path and wait until the frontend has interpreted the payload. Numeric and mixed payload shapes are measured separately because serialization cost and JavaScript parsing behavior can differ significantly.

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
